  "description": "The Laterite is an ideal introduction to drop-bar road cycling, whether you're commuting to work, building fitness or enjoying weekend rides on the open road. Its lightweight 6061 alloy frame features a relaxed endurance geometry that delivers a comfortable riding position for long days in the saddle, while the carbon-bladed fork helps absorb road vibrations for a smoother ride. Paired with wide 700x30c tyres, the Laterite offers added comfort and confidence across a variety of road surfaces.\n\nDesigned for riders looking for a modern road bike at an affordable price, the Laterite combines dependable Shimano Claris 2x8 gearing with responsive Tektro dual-pivot calliper brakes for reliable performance. A durable alloy wheelset and versatile Vee Apache tyres complete a capable package that's equally suited to commuting, leisure rides and building confidence on the road.",
